      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalemeshaŋa kakweji kaAbibi, wakamudiili Yehova Nzambi yeyi ŋaseka; muloŋa mukakweji kaAbibi dimu mwakufumishiliyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi muEjipitu nawufuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamuketwili Yehova Nzambi yeyi ŋaseka yamwiyinda deyi niyamwitaŋa deyi kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova kushakamishaku ijina dindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakayidyaŋa namankendi eluŋuku; wakayidyaŋa mafuku atanu nayedi namankendi akadi iluŋi, kafwampi himankendi ayihuŋu; muloŋa eyi wafumini mwituŋa daEjipitu chalufuchihohu; kulonda hamafuku ejima iwakahandaŋa wakaanukaŋa ifuku diwafumini mwituŋa daEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mupinza jeyi jejima bayi akamona ŋamuiluŋi mwitala deyi mafuku atanu nayeduku; hela mbiji yiwakaketula hefukudakusambila hamelela, bayi yakashalahu wufuku wejima yishika nikubudiduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiwakatwesha kuketwila ŋaseka hamuleala weyi wumu wakukwinkayi Yehova Nzambi yeyuku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chiŋa kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi kushakamishahu ijina dindi, diku kuwakaketwila ŋasekahamelela, hakuholoka itaŋwa, hachila aka chiwafumini muEjipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamwochi, hiwakamudiila kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi; habudidi hiwakabalumuka cheŋi, hiwakaya kumatenti eyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakadyaŋa mankendi akadi iluŋi mafuku atanu nadimu; hefuku damu chitanu nachiyedi hakekalaŋa kupompa kwakudihudika kwakumupompela Yehova Nzambi yeyi; kukoŋa nyidimu nehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kachindi nyilungu yeyi yitanu nayiyedi; hiwakatachikila kuchinda nyilungu yitanu nayiyedi hohiwakatwalaŋa chikwakwa kutidiku yemana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamudiili Yehova Nzambi yeyi chawija chanyilungu nahimulambu wa kulambula chakumuchima weyeyi aweni, wakahani mwomwana kukoolekesheliyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakazaŋalalaŋa kumesu aYehova Nzambi yeyi, nineyi, nimwaneyi weyala, nimwaneyi wamumbanda, niŋamba yeyi weyala, niŋamba yeyi wamumbanda, nikaLevi wekala hamukalaweyi, ni mwenyi, ninshona, nintuluwa, ekala mukachi kenu, kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi kushakamishaku ijina dindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waka anukaŋa chiwadiŋi ndupu muEjipitu; wakashi muchima wakwila yidika diyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakadyaŋa chawija chayisolu mafuku atanu nayedi, hiwakela wunakupuli dehi niyakuwuhulilu weyi niyakuwukamwinu weyi wavinyu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakazaŋalalaŋa hachawija cheyi, nineyi, nimwaneyi weyala, nimwaneyi wamumbanda, niŋamba yeyi weyala, niŋamba yeyi wamumbanda, nikaLevi, ni mwenyi, ninshona, nintuluwa, ekala hamukala weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamudiili Yehova Nzambi yeyi chawija mafuku atanu nayedi kuchipela chakatondayi Yehova; nanochu chanakukoolekeshiyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi muyuma yeyi yejima yanavulishiyi, nimunyidimu yejima yiwunakoŋi, hiwakazaŋilala chikupu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala eyi ejima akamwekanaŋa maŋampa kasatu hamwaka mumesu aYehova Nzambi yeyi kuchipela chakatondayi; nihachawija chamankendi akadi iluŋi, nihachawija chanyilungu, nihachawija chayisolu; bayi akamwekanaŋa kumesu aYehova makasakasaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala ejima akahanaŋa mwashikila Ŋovu jawu, mwomwashikila kukooleka kwanakukoolekeshiyi Yehova Nzambi yeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyikala yeyi yejima yakukwinkayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi, mwahitanyichidi yeyi, wakashaŋamu ansompeshi natulala; akasompeshaŋa antu kusompa kwaloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wakaheŋeshaŋa kusompaku; bayi wakaakamaŋa amuntuku, hela kutambula chamukunkulu; muloŋa chamukunkulu chaputishaŋa mesu amukwamaana, chaluwaŋeshaŋa mazu amukwakuloŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayaŋa mwaloŋa hohu, kulonda wakahandi, wakaswani ituŋa dakukwinkayi Yehova Nzambi yeyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
